[TITLE]
Step 4 controls and rules import fixture

[JUNCTIONS]
 J1 100 20
 J2 100 5
 B2 90 0

[RESERVOIRS]
 R1 300
 R2 300

[TANKS]
 T1 150 10 0 20 30 0
 T2 150 10 0 20 30 0

[PIPES]
 L1 J1 T1 1000 12 110 0 Open
 S2 R2 J2 1000 12 110 0 Open
 O2 B2 T2 500 12 110 0 Open

[PUMPS]
 P1 R1 J1 HEAD PH

[VALVES]
 V1 J2 B2 12 PRV 50 0
 VGPV J1 J2 12 GPV GH 0

[CURVES]
 PH 0 150
 PH 100 120
 PH 200 60
 GH 0 0
 GH 100 5
 GH 200 20

[CONTROLS]
 LINK P1 OPEN IF NODE T1 BELOW 5
 LINK P1 CLOSED IF NODE T1 ABOVE 15
 LINK P1 0.8 AT TIME 2:00
 LINK V1 45 AT CLOCKTIME 3:00
 LINK P1 CLOSED AT TIME 5:00 DISABLED
 LINK V1 45 IF NODE J2 BELOW 25 DISABLED
 LINK P1 OPEN IF NODE R1 BELOW 5 DISABLED
 LINK P1 1.0 AT TIME 4:00 DISABLED
 LINK VGPV OPEN AT TIME 0:30
 LINK VGPV CLOSED AT TIME 1:30

[RULES]
 RULE R_LEVEL
 IF NODE T1 LEVEL BELOW 8
 AND SYSTEM TIME >= 1:00
 THEN LINK P1 SETTING = 0.9
 ELSE LINK P1 STATUS = OPEN
 PRIORITY 3.5

 RULE R_FLOW
 IF LINK L1 FLOW > 10
 OR LINK V1 STATUS IS ACTIVE
 THEN LINK V1 SETTING = 40
 ELSE LINK V1 STATUS = OPEN
 PRIORITY 2

 RULE R_SYSTEM
 IF SYSTEM DEMAND > 5
 AND NODE J1 PRESSURE > 20
 THEN LINK P1 STATUS = OPEN
 PRIORITY 1
 DISABLED

[TIMES]
 Duration 6:00
 Hydraulic Timestep 1:00
 Rule Timestep 0:05

[REPORT]
 Status No
 Summary No

[OPTIONS]
 Units GPM
 Pressure PSI
 Headloss H-W
 Quality None

[END]
